{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30007_01_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:30a7abd437fc900438e512dd8572c822503e88a9f530bbc5baabcedab4967bf7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c16a8f8ec8c080783e388dbf6f0370705ee80121b4b902835ffb2762daac595",
      "text": "既然这样，这个企划怎么样！\n就是那个“想看各位平时的舞蹈练习”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdcbac05768ebfbd454cfb4c5445639a555a39f3faecdeb17f224df403df96d8",
      "text": "听起来挺有意思的呢。印象中好像确实\n没怎么给粉丝们展示过平时的舞蹈练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef149ba632ea31b152bd59329e647f0f0aad928769ecf2a1dfb7988e1ccf071d",
      "text": "我好像也从没公开过\n自己练舞时的样子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97ff7ee2d1bdc0f64e5ddf221124d8b9999a9d10ff4d8f2ddea39c1877fa0e4a",
      "text": "虽然在其他视频里也出现过相同的桥段，\n但反响相当不错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f7625cbef97fb995053c14df25285d497257e1414990d5462fb0d1e11794bbc",
      "text": "如果我们也要做的话，\n大概需要换一种不同的切入点吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a852b9f6b0135a8901c65dc84e9beea53c838ce71c0975b051f141c7560a78fa",
      "text": "那这样呢，选一首让看这个频道的观众们\n都耳熟能详的曲子怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dfcd86f4bb4175a6bb6e297d8a7cfc7a0255c7b4271353c0dd74111391d2955",
      "text": "这个系列视频不是有3首片尾曲嘛。\n观众们应该也对MV很熟悉了，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1339f642654f3a1650f0c565a0f663b9514ac44858b1b88cbb40f29eb5d64d7",
      "text": "所以去跳另外2首片尾曲的舞蹈，\n这个企划怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f709c2a43de95925b8da7004f1ec29180f40b7546f24b0f566eeb63e0dd03624",
      "text": "哦哦，也就是展示那两首歌的练舞过程啊！\n这样一来肯定会更有趣的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000107:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e583fb19f15a72802dac751a354022915be32026a03abc48de3b7502e72dff1b",
      "text": "……这次的企划就定为这个了吧。\n那么，向观众们公布吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ccfbdb8d662fb9abbb26e6894461821fc379e09e31690b70861c60681fbf0d8",
      "text": "我们在这个视频里要挑战的企划是……这个哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
